+    // have one depth, so they skip interpolation and its rounding altogether.
+    // The test uses the full value, as WritePixel does: the save thumbnail draws
+    // at 0xFFFFFFFF (a float rounds that to 2^32, which uint() can't hold) and must
+    // pass "greater" against a stored 0xFFFFFF. Only the store is masked.
